 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-reserva-2-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) sabiendo que \\(f'(x)=2x^3-6x^2\\) y que su valor mínimo es \\(-12\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula la ecuación de las rectas tangentes a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en los puntos de inflexión de su gráfica."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(x)=\\int(2x^3-6x^2)\\,dx=\\frac{x^4}2-2x^3+C\\]<p>Busco el mínimo con el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>: \\(f'(x)=2x^2(x-3)=0\\iff\\boxed{x=0},\\ \\boxed{x=3}\\).</p><div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(4) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,3)\\) (en \\(x=0\\) no cambia) y crece en \\((3,+\\infty)\\): el mínimo (absoluto) está en \\(x=3\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>:</p>\\[f(3)=\\frac{81}2-54+C=-\\frac{27}2+C=-12\\iff C=\\frac32\\]<div class='res'>\\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^4}2-2x^3+\\dfrac32\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f''(x)=6x^2-12x=6x(x-2)=0\\iff\\boxed{x=0},\\ \\boxed{x=2}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M51.0 12Q67.0 48 83.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(−1) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M133.0 40Q149.0 4 165.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(1) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M215.0 12Q231.0 48 247.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(3) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f''\\) cambia de signo en los dos: son puntos de inflexión.</p><p>• \\(x=0\\): \\(f(0)=\\frac32\\), \\(f'(0)=0\\): \\(y=\\frac32\\).<br>• \\(x=2\\): \\(f(2)=8-16+\\frac32=-\\frac{13}2\\), \\(f'(2)=16-24=-8\\): \\(y+\\frac{13}2=-8(x-2)\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(y=\\dfrac32\\) e \\(y=-8x+\\dfrac{19}2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
