  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-reserva-2-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x\\,|x-4|\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Estudia su derivabilidad en \\(x=4\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y el eje de abscisas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}4x-x^2&\\text{si }x\\lt4\\\\x^2-4x&\\text{si }x\\geq4\\end{cases}\\]<p>Para \\(x\\lt4\\), parábola hacia abajo con vértice \\((2,4)\\) y cortes en 0 y 4; para \\(x\\geq4\\), parábola hacia arriba que sale de \\((4,0)\\) creciendo.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='57.1,150.0 60.9,142.2 64.6,134.8 68.3,127.8 72.0,121.2 75.7,115.0 79.4,109.2 83.1,103.8 86.9,98.8 90.6,94.2 94.3,90.0 98.0,86.2 101.7,82.8 105.4,79.8 109.1,77.2 112.9,75.0 116.6,73.2 120.3,71.8 124.0,70.8 127.7,70.2 131.4,70.0 135.1,70.2 138.9,70.8 142.6,71.8 146.3,73.2 150.0,75.0 153.7,77.2 157.4,79.8 161.1,82.8 164.9,86.2 168.6,90.0 172.3,94.2 176.0,98.8 179.7,103.8 183.4,109.2 187.1,115.0 190.9,121.2 194.6,127.8 198.3,134.8 202.0,142.2 205.7,150.0 205.7,150.0 202.0,150.0 198.3,150.0 194.6,150.0 190.9,150.0 187.1,150.0 183.4,150.0 179.7,150.0 176.0,150.0 172.3,150.0 168.6,150.0 164.9,150.0 161.1,150.0 157.4,150.0 153.7,150.0 150.0,150.0 146.3,150.0 142.6,150.0 138.9,150.0 135.1,150.0 131.4,150.0 127.7,150.0 124.0,150.0 120.3,150.0 116.6,150.0 112.9,150.0 109.1,150.0 105.4,150.0 101.7,150.0 98.0,150.0 94.3,150.0 90.6,150.0 86.9,150.0 83.1,150.0 79.4,150.0 75.7,150.0 72.0,150.0 68.3,150.0 64.6,150.0 60.9,150.0 57.1,150.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='34.9,205.2 36.5,200.6 38.1,196.1 39.8,191.7 41.4,187.4 43.1,183.2 44.7,179.0 46.4,174.9 48.0,170.9 49.7,166.9 51.3,163.1 53.0,159.3 54.6,155.6 56.2,152.0 57.9,148.4 59.5,144.9 61.2,141.6 62.8,138.2 64.5,135.0 66.1,131.9 67.8,128.8 69.4,125.8 71.0,122.9 72.7,120.0 74.3,117.3 76.0,114.6 77.6,112.0 79.3,109.4 80.9,107.0 82.6,104.6 84.2,102.3 85.8,100.1 87.5,98.0 89.1,95.9 90.8,93.9 92.4,92.0 94.1,90.2 95.7,88.5 97.4,86.8 99.0,85.2 100.7,83.7 102.3,82.3 103.9,81.0 105.6,79.7 107.2,78.5 108.9,77.4 110.5,76.3 112.2,75.4 113.8,74.5 115.5,73.7 117.1,73.0 118.7,72.3 120.4,71.8 122.0,71.3 123.7,70.9 125.3,70.5 127.0,70.3 128.6,70.1 130.3,70.0 131.9,70.0 133.6,70.1 135.2,70.2 136.8,70.4 138.5,70.7 140.1,71.1 141.8,71.6 143.4,72.1 145.1,72.7 146.7,73.4 148.4,74.2 150.0,75.0 151.6,75.9 153.3,76.9 154.9,78.0 156.6,79.2 158.2,80.4 159.9,81.7 161.5,83.1 163.2,84.6 164.8,86.1 166.4,87.8 168.1,89.5 169.7,91.3 171.4,93.1 173.0,95.1 174.7,97.1 176.3,99.2 178.0,101.4 179.6,103.7 181.3,106.0 182.9,108.4 184.5,110.9 186.2,113.5 187.8,116.1 189.5,118.9 191.1,121.7 192.8,124.5 194.4,127.5 196.1,130.6 197.7,133.7 199.3,136.9 201.0,140.2 202.6,143.5 204.3,146.9 205.9,149.5 207.6,146.0 209.2,142.3 210.9,138.5 212.5,134.7 214.2,130.8 215.8,126.8 217.4,122.7 219.1,118.6 220.7,114.4 222.4,110.1 224.0,105.7 225.7,101.3 227.3,96.7 229.0,92.1 230.6,87.4 232.2,82.7 233.9,77.8 235.5,72.9 237.2,67.9 238.8,62.8 240.5,57.6 242.1,52.4 243.8,47.1 245.4,41.7 247.0,36.2 248.7,30.6 250.3,25.0 252.0,19.3 253.6,13.5 255.3,7.7 256.9,1.7 258.6,-4.3 260.2,-10.4 261.9,-16.6 263.5,-22.9 265.1,-29.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='131.4' cy='70.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='137.4' y='64.0'>(2,4)</text><circle cx='205.7' cy='150.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='209.7' y='164.0'>(4,0)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 150.0H294.0M57.1 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='131.4' y1='147.0' x2='131.4' y2='153.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='128.4' y='164.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='205.7' y1='147.0' x2='205.7' y2='153.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='202.7' y='164.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='54.1' y1='110.0' x2='60.1' y2='110.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='41.1' y='114.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='54.1' y1='70.0' x2='60.1' y2='70.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='41.1' y='74.0' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es continua en \\(x=4\\) (los dos trozos valen 0). \\(f'(4^-)=4-2\\cdot4=-4\\) y \\(f'(4^+)=2\\cdot4-4=4\\).</p><div class='res'>No es derivable en \\(x=4\\) (punto anguloso)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Corta al eje en \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=4\\); entre ellos es positiva:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^4(4x-x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[2x^2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^4=32-\\frac{64}3=\\frac{32}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{32}3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
