  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-reserva-2-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera los puntos \\(A(1,-1,2)\\), \\(B(1,3,0)\\) y \\(C(0,0,1)\\). Halla el punto simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de la recta que pasa por \\(B\\) y \\(C\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta pasa por \\(C(0,0,1)\\) con director \\(\\overrightarrow{CB}=(1,3,-1)\\): \\(r\\equiv(t,\\,3t,\\,1-t)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(1,\\ 3,\\ -1)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x+3y-z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(A(1,\\ -1,\\ 2)\\): \\(1+3\\cdot(-1)-2+D=0\\iff D=4\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x+3y-z+4=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[(t)+3(3t)-(1-t)+4=0\\iff 11t+3=0\\iff t=-\\frac{3}{11}\\]\\[M\\left(-\\frac{3}{11},\\ -\\frac{9}{11},\\ \\frac{14}{11}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(A\\) y su simétrico \\(A'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=-\\frac{3}{11},\\qquad\\frac{-1+b}2=-\\frac{9}{11},\\qquad\\frac{2+c}2=\\frac{14}{11}\\]\\[a=-\\frac{17}{11},\\qquad b=-\\frac{7}{11},\\qquad c=\\frac{6}{11}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":20,\"el\":21,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-2.253,0.402,2.953],[2.044,-1.03,2.953],[1.708,-2.039,-0.408],[-2.589,-0.606,-0.408]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.708,-2.039,-0.408],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-0.182,-0.547,1.182],[0.076,-0.584,1.33],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.076,-0.584,1.33],[-0.014,-0.855,1.42],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.948,-2.844,1.948],[0.403,1.208,0.597],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.403,1.208,0.597],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[-0.092,-0.275,1.092],[0.24,0.72,0.76],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[-0.79,-0.744,0.977],[-0.458,0.251,0.646],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[1.0,-1.0,2.0],[-1.545,-0.636,0.545],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[1.0,-1.0,2.0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-0.273,-0.818,1.273],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-1.545,-0.636,0.545],\"A′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m02r2a3n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m02r2a3d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m02r2a3g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m02r2a3r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='225.3,18.0 71.5,87.5 26.0,246.0 179.9,176.5' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='137.9' y1='140.1' x2='131.2' y2='137.1' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='131.2' y1='137.1' x2='118.9' y2='129.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='34.3' y1='71.6' x2='217.1' y2='192.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='223.1' y='192.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='150.2' y1='148.2' x2='195.0' y2='177.9' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m02r2a3d)'/><text x='199.0' y='173.9' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='139.1' y1='138.1' x2='184.0' y2='167.7' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m02r2a3n)'/><text x='190.0' y='177.7' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='92.6' y1='117.1' x2='158.8' y2='146.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='92.6' cy='117.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='99.6' y='111.1' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='125.7' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='133.7' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='158.8' cy='146.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='165.8' y='140.9' font-weight='700'>A′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='18.5' y2='275.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='13.6' y='281.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.0' y2='272.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='41.3' y='276.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(A'\\left(-\\frac{17}{11},\\ -\\frac{7}{11},\\ \\frac{6}{11}\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{AM}=\\left(-\\frac{14}{11},\\ \\frac{2}{11},\\ -\\frac{8}{11}\\right)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\((-\\frac{14}{11})+3\\cdot\\frac{2}{11}-(-\\frac{8}{11})=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
