  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-reserva-2-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha&1&1\\\\-1&3&2\\\\2&1-\\alpha&3\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha-1&0&-1\\\\1&-1&2\\\\0&-\\alpha&0\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(b=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\-5\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(c=\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\5\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\). Determina \\(\\alpha\\), si es posible, para que los sistemas de ecuaciones (dados en forma matricial) \\(AX=b\\), \\(BX=c\\) tengan infinitas soluciones (cada uno de ellos).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cada sistema tiene infinitas soluciones si es compatible indeterminado<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>: hace falta, en primer lugar, que el determinante de su matriz sea 0. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\alpha&1&1\\\\-1&3&2\\\\2&1-\\alpha&3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(9 \\alpha+4+\\alpha - 1\\bigr)-\\bigl(6- 2 \\alpha^{2} + 2 \\alpha-3\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\alpha^2+8\\alpha=2\\alpha(\\alpha+4)\\]\\[|B|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\alpha-1&0&-1\\\\1&-1&2\\\\0&-\\alpha&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+\\alpha\\bigr)-\\bigl(0- 2 \\alpha^{2} + 2 \\alpha+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\alpha^2-\\alpha=\\alpha(2\\alpha-1)\\]<p>El único valor que anula los dos es \\(\\alpha=0\\). Compruebo que con él ambos son compatibles.</p><p>\\(AX=b\\)<b>, </b>\\(\\alpha=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}0&1\\\\-1&3\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\), \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\((A|b)\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}0&1&-1\\\\-1&3&-5\\\\2&1&3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0-10+1\\bigr)-\\bigl(-6+0-3\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(BX=c\\)<b>, </b>\\(\\alpha=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-1&0\\\\1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\), \\(\\operatorname{rg}B=2\\). Menor de \\((B|c)\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4 (la 3.ª fila es nula):</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-1&0&-2\\\\1&-1&5\\\\0&0&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>En los dos, rango 2 = rango de la ampliada \\(\\lt3\\): compatibles indeterminados.</p><div class='res'>\\(\\alpha=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
