    "intro": "Considera el recinto limitado por la curva \\(y=\\frac13x^2\\) y la recta \\(y=9\\). De entre los rectángulos situados como el de la figura, determina el que tiene área máxima.<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='66.0,46.7 82.8,46.7 99.6,46.7 116.4,46.7 133.2,46.7 150.0,46.7 166.8,46.7 183.6,46.7 200.4,46.7 217.2,46.7 234.0,46.7 234.0,88.3 217.2,88.3 200.4,88.3 183.6,88.3 166.8,88.3 150.0,88.3 133.2,88.3 116.4,88.3 99.6,88.3 82.8,88.3 66.0,88.3' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='30.0,6.7 33.0,14.6 36.0,22.3 39.0,29.8 42.0,37.1 45.0,44.2 48.0,51.1 51.0,57.8 54.0,64.3 57.0,70.6 60.0,76.7 63.0,82.6 66.0,88.3 69.0,93.8 72.0,99.1 75.0,104.2 78.0,109.1 81.0,113.8 84.0,118.3 87.0,122.6 90.0,126.7 93.0,130.6 96.0,134.3 99.0,137.8 102.0,141.1 105.0,144.2 108.0,147.1 111.0,149.8 114.0,152.3 117.0,154.6 120.0,156.7 123.0,158.6 126.0,160.3 129.0,161.8 132.0,163.1 135.0,164.2 138.0,165.1 141.0,165.8 144.0,166.3 147.0,166.6 150.0,166.7 153.0,166.6 156.0,166.3 159.0,165.8 162.0,165.1 165.0,164.2 168.0,163.1 171.0,161.8 174.0,160.3 177.0,158.6 180.0,156.7 183.0,154.6 186.0,152.3 189.0,149.8 192.0,147.1 195.0,144.2 198.0,141.1 201.0,137.8 204.0,134.3 207.0,130.6 210.0,126.7 213.0,122.6 216.0,118.3 219.0,113.8 222.0,109.1 225.0,104.2 228.0,99.1 231.0,93.8 234.0,88.3 237.0,82.6 240.0,76.7 243.0,70.6 246.0,64.3 249.0,57.8 252.0,51.1 255.0,44.2 258.0,37.1 261.0,29.8 264.0,22.3 267.0,14.6 270.0,6.7' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,46.7 150.0,46.7 280.0,46.7' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='66.0' y1='88.3' x2='66.0' y2='46.7' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='234.0' y1='88.3' x2='234.0' y2='46.7' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='66.0' y1='88.3' x2='234.0' y2='88.3' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 166.7H294.0M150.0 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='147.0' y1='46.7' x2='153.0' y2='46.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='50.7' font-size='10'>9</text></svg></div>",
