   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por la simetría, los vértices inferiores son \\(\\left(\\pm x,\\frac{x^2}3\\right)\\) con \\(0\\lt x\\lt\\sqrt{27}\\) (donde la parábola alcanza \\(y=9\\)). Base \\(2x\\), altura \\(9-\\frac{x^2}3\\):</p>\\[A(x)=2x\\left(9-\\frac{x^2}3\\right)=18x-\\frac23x^3\\]<p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(A'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[A'(x)=18-2x^2=0\\iff\\boxed{x=3}\\ (x\\gt0)\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>√27</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stro