\\int_1^e(1-\\ln x)\\,dx=1+\\bigl[x-(x\\ln x-x)\\bigr]_1^e=1+\\bigl[2x-x\\ln x\\bigr]_1^e=1+(2e-e)-2=e-1\\]<p>(\\(\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x\\), por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>.)</p><div class='res'>Área \\(=e-1\\approx1{,}72\\ u^2\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Integrando respecto de \\(y\\): \\(\\int_0^1e^y\\,dy=e-1\\) ✓.</i></div>"
