   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(\\pi\\) el plano de ecuación \\(3x-y+2z-4=0\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano \\(\\pi_1\\) que es paralelo a \\(\\pi\\) y pasa por el punto \\(P(1,-2,2)\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano \\(\\pi_2\\) perpendicular a ambos que contiene a la recta \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x-y+z=1\\\\2x+y-4z=1\\end{cases}\\)"
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paralelo a \\(\\pi\\): \\(3x-y+2z+D=0\\). Pasa por \\(P\\): \\(3+2+4+D=0\\iff D=-9\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\pi_1\\equiv3x-y+2z-9=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Director de \\(r\\): \\((1,-1,1)\\times(2,1,-4)=(3,6,3)\\parallel\\vec d=(1,2,1)\\). Con \\(z=0\\): \\(x-y=1\\), \\(2x+y=1\\Rightarrow R\\left(\\frac23,-\\frac13,0\\right)\\).</p><p>\\(\\pi_2\\) contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a la normal \\(\\vec n=(3,-1,2)\\) de \\(\\pi\\) (y de \\(\\pi_1\\)), por ser perpendicular a ellos:</p>\\[\\vec n_2=\\vec d\\times\\vec n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&2&1\\\\3&-1&2\\end{vmatrix}=(5,\\,1,\\,-7)\\]<p>Plano \\(5x+y-7z+D=0\\) por \\(R\\): \\(\\frac{10}3-\\frac13+D=0\\iff D=-3\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":171,\"el\":12,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.333,-2.333,-1.0],[1.667,1.667,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.667,1.667,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[1.849,2.009,1.172],[2.659,-2.041,1.172],[-0.509,-2.674,-1.181],[-1.319,1.375,-1.181]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-0.509,-2.674,-1.181],\"π₂\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[0.352,1.27,3.44],[-0.88,-2.427,3.44],[0.948,-3.037,0.393],[2.18,0.661,0.393]],\"rgba(22,163,74,.18)\",\"#16a34a\"],[\"txt\",[0.948,-3.037,0.393],\"π₁\",\"#16a34a\",4,0],[\"pt\",[1,-2,2],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m02r2b3n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m02r2b3d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m02r2b3g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m02r2b3r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='242.9' y1='222.6' x2='43.2' y2='117.8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='49.2' y='117.8' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><polygon points='26.0,108.7 207.4,94.7 260.0,232.0 78.5,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='264.0' y='232.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₂</text><polygon points='71.2,18.0 251.3,24.2 266.1,145.3 86.0,139.1' fill='rgba(22,163,74,.18)' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='270.1' y='145.3' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₁</text><circle cx='217.7' cy='72.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='224.7' y='66.8' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='21.5' y2='266.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='17.6' y='269.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.2' y2='270.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.3' y='274.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\pi_2\\equiv5x+y-7z-3=0\\)</div></div>"
